\begin{proposition}[Silent-Void Logarithmic Form]
The silent-void function satisfies
\[
\ln F = - n_*\,\lambda_{\text{abio}}\,
\frac{4}{3}\pi
\left(\frac{v_{\text{probe}}}{\Gamma_{\text{filter}}}\right)^3
p_{\text{comm}}.
\]
\end{proposition}

\begin{proof}
Substitute the definition of $\Lambda$ into $F = \exp(-\Lambda)$ and take the 
natural logarithm.
\end{proof}